1
00:00:00,028 --> 00:00:03,598
(Josh:)I've always dreamed of having
a brother to play catch with.

2
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:06,199
(Bernadette:)Keep dreaming.

3
00:00:07,201 --> 00:00:08,431
(Howard:)Hey, I threw out the first pitch

4
00:00:08,437 --> 00:00:10,207
(Howard:)at an Angels game.
Wow.

5
00:00:10,205 --> 00:00:13,005
(Bernadette:)He did it with a robot.

6
00:00:13,941 --> 00:00:16,711
(Josh:)You had sex with a robot?

7
00:00:16,712 --> 00:00:19,012
(Howard:)That's not what she meant.

8
00:00:19,014 --> 00:00:20,384
(Raj:)But technically, yes.

9
00:00:23,150 --> 00:00:24,820
(Leonard:)Hang on, if you're making
all this money,

10
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:26,320
(Leonard:)where is it?

11
00:00:26,321 --> 00:00:27,551
(Penny:)In a safe place.

12
00:00:27,556 --> 00:00:29,156
(Leonard:)What does that mean,
under your bed?

13
00:00:29,157 --> 00:00:30,457
(Penny:)No, it means

14
00:00:30,459 --> 00:00:32,789
(Penny:)a diversified portfolio
of stocks and bonds.

15
00:00:32,794 --> 00:00:34,164
(Penny:)I'm not overly conservative.

16
00:00:34,162 --> 00:00:37,962
(Penny:)I'm young, so my guy said I
can afford to take some risks.

17
00:00:37,966 --> 00:00:40,466
Wait a minute, you have "a guy"?

18
00:00:40,469 --> 00:00:41,839
(Penny:)Don't you have a guy?

19
00:00:41,837 --> 00:00:44,967
(Leonard:)Why would I have a guy?
I don't have any money!

20
00:00:45,706 --> 00:00:47,206
(Penny:)Oh, sweetie,

21
00:00:47,209 --> 00:00:49,479
(Penny:)you should really
get some money.

22
00:00:49,478 --> 00:00:51,708
(Wil:)For those of you listening
at home,

23
00:00:51,713 --> 00:00:54,753
(Wil:)how great is this?

24
00:00:54,750 --> 00:00:57,480
(Leonard:)Wil, I'm begging you,
just please turn that off.

25
00:00:57,486 --> 00:01:00,186
(Leonard:)Sure.

